<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Trade_with_preet | Trading Education</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #0b1220;
      color: #f5f7fb;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(1100px, 90%);
      margin: auto;
    }

    header {
      padding: 20px 0;
      background: #101a2d;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #26334b;
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .logo { font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: bold; color: #64e6a5; }
    nav a { color: #e8edf5; text-decoration: none; margin-left: 18px; }

    .hero {
      padding: 100px 0;
      text-align: center;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #173b3a, #0b1220 65%);
    }

    .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4.5rem); line-height: 1.1; }
    .hero h1 span { color: #64e6a5; }
    .hero p { max-width: 650px; margin: 20px auto 28px; color: #bdc7d8; }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #64e6a5;
      color: #08130e;
      padding: 12px 22px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    section { padding: 70px 0; }
    h2 { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .intro { color: #bdc7d8; max-width: 700px; margin-bottom: 30px; }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .card {
      background: #121e32;
      border: 1px solid #26334b;
      padding: 24px;
      border-radius: 14px;
    }

    .card h3 { color: #64e6a5; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .card p { color: #bdc7d8; }

    .notice {
      background: #171f2d;
      border-left: 4px solid #f2c14e;
      padding: 18px;
      color: #d7deea;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    .contact { text-align: center; }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 24px 0;
      color: #9eabc0;
      border-top: 1px solid #26334b;
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      nav { flex-direction: column; }
      nav a { margin: 0 8px; }
      .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero { padding: 75px 0; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <div class="container">
      <nav>
        <div class="logo">Trade_with_preet</div>
        <div>
          <a href="#about">About</a>
          <a href="#topics">Topics</a>
          <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>Learn trading with <span>Trade_with_preet</span></h1>
        <p>
          Trading ke concepts, market basics aur risk management ko samajhne ke
          liye educational resources dekhein.
        </p>
        <a class="button" href="#topics">Explore Topics</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>About</h2>
        <p class="intro">
          Trade_with_preet ek educational page hai jo trading se judi basic
          jaankari share karne ke liye banaya gaya hai. Yahan apna introduction
          aur experience apne hisaab se add karein.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="topics">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Learning Topics</h2>
        <p class="intro">Apne content ke mutabiq in sections ko edit kar sakte hain.</p>

        <div class="cards">
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Market Basics</h3>
            <p>Trading terms, charts aur market ke basic concepts ke baare mein seekhein.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <h3>Risk Management</h3>
            <p>Risk ko samajhna aur responsible decision-making ki ahmiyat jaaniye.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <h3>Learning Resources</h3>
            <p>Apne educational videos, articles ya social media links yahan share karein.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <div class="notice">
          <strong>Disclaimer:</strong> Yeh website sirf educational information ke liye hai,
          financial advice nahi. Trading mein financial loss ka risk hota hai.
          Koi bhi decision lene se pehle apni research karein aur zarurat par
          qualified financial professional se salah lein.
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="contact" id="contact">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p class="intro" style="margin: 0 auto 22px;">
          Apne contact ya social media details yahan add karein.
        </p>
        <a class="button" href="https://instagram.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          Instagram par milen
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">© 2026 Trade_with_preet</div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>